+---
+description: "Records a persistence type transition and its compatibility acknowledgement."
+kind: persistence-change
+---
+
+# 2026-11-05-strata-turn-bound-steering
+
+English | [中文](2026-11-05-strata-turn-bound-steering.zh.md)
+
+## Summary
+
+Adds optional steeringTurn provenance to user RPC message sources for the Strata soft-cut source patch.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Declaration](#declaration)
+- [Compatibility](#compatibility)
+- [Verification](#verification)
+- [Dev Note](#dev-note)
+
+<a id="declaration"></a>
+## Declaration
+
+```yaml persistence-change
+schemaVersion: 1
+id: 2026-11-05-strata-turn-bound-steering
+baseline: false
+changes:
+  - root: "event:agent/inbox/spliced"
+    previous: "2026-10-13-user-rpc-principal"
+    after: "6aadff928d2a95bbfd62d82b0a31b8d8075328606c5c37c8da19218b722e312c"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:developer/message"
+    previous: "2026-10-13-user-rpc-principal"
+    after: "51b609411089e8f1f3c81515890836cdbd03efa1313ee6a9b2182a9dabd59d95"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:session/title-llm-request"
+    previous: "2026-10-13-user-rpc-principal"
+    after: "63c7c49c6751af37531365fd35a25bd87f4ba4454b25364df34f743ca42e647e"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:user/message"
+    previous: "2026-10-13-user-rpc-principal"
+    after: "1a509ff7fd44f80fdda58a57dcd12b0b55a98e16ea152c46fcba2f50ffcf779b"
+    decision: same-version
+```
+
+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## Compatibility
+
+Existing messages remain valid because the field is optional. Older readers preserve or ignore the extra source metadata. Version 2 soft-cut producers write it only after synchronously checking expectedTurn against the open parent turn. Duplicate requests must match this original binding. Queue and ordinary steer messages keep their previous source representation; no Session writer version change is required.
+
+<a id="verification"></a>
+## Verification
+
+The four focused Harness source files passed 126 tests. The Host/Gateway scripted-Harness and UI suite passed 61 tests, including the controlled A-end/B-start admission race, duplicate identities, tools, helpers and cancellation. Harness build:artifacts and build:check passed. No real-model run was performed.
+
+<a id="dev-note"></a>
+## Dev Note
+
+None.
